User-visible changes to tkwintrack in between releases:

--- 24-Dec-2020  Release 1.0b1 ---

* Remember settings per client application
* Indicate the client interpreter in the configuration dialog
* Add wintrackgui icon to the title bar
* Add a (hidden) about frame
* Some lay-out improvements of the config dialog

--- 24-Feb-2021  Release 1.1.0 ---

* Rename the package to tkwintrack
* (bug fix) pathname widget background colour doesn't adapt on MS Windows
* (bug fix) file format of icon (window manager decoration) doesn't support
  Tk8.5
* Make test script configurable from command line only, using option -wtune
  with default value 1.0
* Add tests for reconfigure actions to test script
* Enhance documentation, notably regarding the test script

--- 8-Jul-2021  Release 2.0.0 ---

* (bug fix) reckon with file system path names containing spaces

--- 10-Jul-2021  Release 2.0.1 ---

* (enhancement) employ enhanced detection mechanism provided by windetect 2.0
* (enhancement) allow lifting restriction to execute on unsupported platforms
* (bug fix) prevent error when the outline widget is destroyed by the client
  application
* (bug fix) prevent error when toggling off detection functionality if
  the outlined window has been destroyed
* (bug fix) correct check for Tk version requirement
* (test enhancement) use gui-integration tests from package windetect 2.0
* (test enhancement) make tests insensitive to variability among windowing
  systems and window managers w.r.t. timeliness of event notifications,
  thereby considerably speeding up test execution.
* (test enhancement) remove test option -wtune, obsoleted by the previous
  enhancement, and add test option -eyefriendly.
* Various documentation improvements.

--- 17-Sep-2024  Release 2.1.0 ---

* (bug fix) prevent error when destroying toplevel for tracked window during cfg
  dialog display (#3)
* (doc fix) add test option -nowm to the list of supported options (#4)
* (test bugfix) correct test aboutbox-1.1 with tk9.0.0 under x11 (#5)
* (bug fix) correct slow display of config dialog when the client interp frame
  is over the mouse pointer upon mapping (#6)
* (bug fix) correct initial display of pathname widget when option "follow mouse"
  was deselected (#7)

--- 22-Dec-2024  Release 2.1.1 ---
